  "notes": "US Treasury interest-rate XML feed, daily Treasury par yield curve, all maturities (1 month to 30 years), percent, one row per maturity per date with a value (long format; series_code is the feed element, e.g. BC_10YEAR). BC_30YEARDISPLAY and Id are kept in raw and interim only. Maturities start at different dates and the 30-year was not published 2002-02-18 to 2006-02-08 (fixed table in the loader). Methodology changed to monotone convex on 2021-12-06. Not FRED (Proposed ADR-0006). Treasury may correct values without notice, so each run's raw responses are kept (append_only_snapshot) and revisions against the previous run are warned. No explicit Treasury licence was found; use rests on 17 U.S.C. 105 (no US copyright in federal works). published_at = observation_date + 1 day 23:59:59 Asia/Karachi in UTC (basis treasury_same_day_plus_1d).",
